<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In reAR: Rethinking Visual Autoregressive Models via Generator-Tokenizer Consistency Regularization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Qualitative Results</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
