<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">reAR: Rethinking Visual Autoregressive Models via Generator-Tokenizer Consistency Regularization</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
