<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span><span id="A5.F12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Generated Results of reAR-B-AliTok of class ‘Ice cream’</span></figcaption>
